---
title: Sequence Diagram — Create booking
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant R as routes/hotels → routes/bookings
    participant P as protect + authorize
    participant L as bookingLimiter
    participant C as controllers/bookings
    participant H as Hotel model
    participant B as Booking model
    participant DB as MongoDB (transaction)

    U->>R: POST /api/v1/hotels/:hotelId/bookings {checkIn, checkOut}
    R->>P: verify JWT (cookie or Bearer), load user
    alt no / invalid token
        P-->>U: 401 Not authorized
    end
    P->>L: count attempts for this user (5 per minute)
    alt 6th attempt within a minute
        L-->>U: 429 + Retry-After
    end
    L->>C: addBooking(req, res)
    C->>C: parseStay(): 1–3 nights, check-in not in the past
    alt invalid stay
        C-->>U: 400 A booking must be between 1 and 3 nights
    end
    C->>DB: startSession() + withTransaction()
    C->>H: findByIdAndUpdate(hotelId, $inc lockVersion)
    Note over H,DB: two bookings for the same hotel write the same document,<br/>so concurrent transactions conflict and retry (no overbooking)
    alt hotel not found
        C-->>U: 404 No hotel with this id
    end
    C->>B: countDocuments(overlapping dates, not deleted)
    alt booked rooms ≥ totalRooms
        C-->>U: 409 No rooms available
    end
    C->>B: create({checkIn, checkOut, user: req.user, hotel})
    B->>DB: insert booking (status = pending)
    DB-->>C: commit
    C-->>U: 201 Created {booking}
